<Behavior #ai-runtime-lifecycle-hooks apiVersion="codument.tech/v1alpha1" version="1" (
  <Requirements [
    <Requirement #lifecycle-hook-contract (
      <Statement ?01M05F1P0VM6SE6BKM62PPYHVE>
      系统 SHALL 定义 AI runtime hook contract，用于通过现有 module extension/manifest 的 `hooks` 字段声明 Sparrow-aligned hook point、mode、matcher、priority、timeout、failure policy、标准组件 handler 与 result action。
      </?01M05F1P0VM6SE6BKM62PPYHVE>
      <Suites [
        <Suite #contract-shape { name = "Contract shape" } (
          <Cases [
            <Case #descriptor-is-data [
              <Then ?01M05F1P0VM6SE6BKM62PPYHVF>
              hook SHALL 写入现有 module extension/manifest 的 `hooks` 字段
              </?01M05F1P0VM6SE6BKM62PPYHVF>
              <Then ?01M05F1P0VM6SE6BKM62PPYHVG>
              hook point SHALL be a string using `domain.action.phase` naming such as `actor.idle.before` or `tool.execute.after`
              </?01M05F1P0VM6SE6BKM62PPYHVG>
              <Then ?01M05F1P0VM6SE6BKM62PPYHVH>
              hook SHALL 以数据 definition 表达 point、mode、name、extensionId、priority、matcher、timeoutMs、failOpen 与 handler component reference
              </?01M05F1P0VM6SE6BKM62PPYHVH>
              <Then ?01M05F1P0VM6SE6BKM62PPYHVJ>
              hook descriptor SHALL 能被 composer/runtime assembly 收集
              </?01M05F1P0VM6SE6BKM62PPYHVJ>
            ] (
              <Given ?01M05F1P0VM6SE6BKM62PPYHVK>
              某个 module 需要扩展 runtime 生命周期
              </?01M05F1P0VM6SE6BKM62PPYHVK>
              <When ?01M05F1P0VM6SE6BKM62PPYHVM>
              它声明 lifecycle hook
              </?01M05F1P0VM6SE6BKM62PPYHVM>
            )>
            <Case #sparrow-aligned-mode-and-action [
              <Then ?01M05F1P0VM6SE6BKM62PPYHVN>
              mode SHALL be one of `observe`、`transform`、`decision`、`around`
              </?01M05F1P0VM6SE6BKM62PPYHVN>
              <Then ?01M05F1P0VM6SE6BKM62PPYHVP>
              result action SHALL be one of `continue`、`replace`、`deny`、`ask`、`retry`、`stop`
              </?01M05F1P0VM6SE6BKM62PPYHVP>
              <Then ?01M05F1P0VM6SE6BKM62PPYHVQ>
              系统 SHALL NOT introduce a parallel enum-only lifecycle event model for hook points
              </?01M05F1P0VM6SE6BKM62PPYHVQ>
            ] (
              <Given ?01M05F1P0VM6SE6BKM62PPYHVR>
              某个 hook definition 被声明
              </?01M05F1P0VM6SE6BKM62PPYHVR>
              <When ?01M05F1P0VM6SE6BKM62PPYHVS>
              runtime 校验该 hook definition
              </?01M05F1P0VM6SE6BKM62PPYHVS>
            )>
            <Case #result-is-effect-oriented [
              <Then ?01M05F1P0VM6SE6BKM62PPYHVT>
              结果 SHALL 使用标准 action、payload/output/message/metadata 与可选 structured effects 表达需要 runtime 应用的副作用
              </?01M05F1P0VM6SE6BKM62PPYHVT>
              <Then ?01M05F1P0VM6SE6BKM62PPYHVV>
              hook handler SHALL NOT 直接绕过 actor mailbox 修改其他 actor 的内部状态
              </?01M05F1P0VM6SE6BKM62PPYHVV>
            ] (
              <Given ?01M05F1P0VM6SE6BKM62PPYHVW>
              hook handler 完成决策
              </?01M05F1P0VM6SE6BKM62PPYHVW>
              <When ?01M05F1P0VM6SE6BKM62PPYHVX>
              它返回结果
              </?01M05F1P0VM6SE6BKM62PPYHVX>
            )>
            <Case #diagnostic-report-shape [
              <Then ?01M05F1P0VM6SE6BKM62PPYHVY>
              dispatcher SHALL emit a diagnostic report with event type `hook_dispatch_report`
              </?01M05F1P0VM6SE6BKM62PPYHVY>
              <Then ?01M05F1P0VM6SE6BKM62PPYHVZ>
              report SHALL include point、trace/session/actor context、final action、elapsed time、steps、payload 与 output
              </?01M05F1P0VM6SE6BKM62PPYHVZ>
            ] (
              <Given ?01M05F1P0VM6SE6BKM62PPYHW0>
              dispatcher 完成一次 hook dispatch
              </?01M05F1P0VM6SE6BKM62PPYHW0>
              <When ?01M05F1P0VM6SE6BKM62PPYHW1>
              至少一个 hook 被 matched、failed、timed out 或 skipped by reentrancy
              </?01M05F1P0VM6SE6BKM62PPYHW1>
            )>
          ]>
        )>
      ]>
    )>
    <Requirement #organ-hook-dispatcher (
      <Statement ?01M05F1P0VM6SE6BKM62PPYHW2>
      系统 SHALL 在 `ai-organ-logic` 中提供 hook dispatcher，负责匹配、排序、reentrancy guard、预算、timeout、错误策略、`hook_dispatch_report` diagnostics、标准组件 handler 调用与 result/effect 归一化。
      </?01M05F1P0VM6SE6BKM62PPYHW2>
      <Suites [
        <Suite #dispatch-semantics { name = "Dispatch semantics" } (
          <Cases [
            <Case #matches-and-sorts [
              <Then ?01M05F1P0VM6SE6BKM62PPYHW3>
              dispatcher SHALL 只执行 point 与 matcher 匹配的 hooks
              </?01M05F1P0VM6SE6BKM62PPYHW3>
              <Then ?01M05F1P0VM6SE6BKM62PPYHW4>
              dispatcher SHALL 按 phase、priority desc、extensionId、name 形成稳定顺序
              </?01M05F1P0VM6SE6BKM62PPYHW4>
            ] (
              <Given ?01M05F1P0VM6SE6BKM62PPYHW5>
              runtime assembly 中存在多个 enabled hook descriptors
              </?01M05F1P0VM6SE6BKM62PPYHW5>
              <When ?01M05F1P0VM6SE6BKM62PPYHW6>
              dispatcher 收到某个 lifecycle invocation
              </?01M05F1P0VM6SE6BKM62PPYHW6>
            )>
            <Case #reentrant-skip [
              <Then ?01M05F1P0VM6SE6BKM62PPYHW7>
              dispatcher SHALL 跳过 reentrant invocation
              </?01M05F1P0VM6SE6BKM62PPYHW7>
              <Then ?01M05F1P0VM6SE6BKM62PPYHW8>
              dispatcher SHALL 记录 reentrant skipped diagnostic
              </?01M05F1P0VM6SE6BKM62PPYHW8>
            ] (
              <Given ?01M05F1P0VM6SE6BKM62PPYHW9>
              某个 hook 正在同一 point 上执行
              </?01M05F1P0VM6SE6BKM62PPYHW9>
              <When ?01M05F1P0VM6SE6BKM62PPYHWA>
              hook 执行过程中再次触发相同 guard key 的 hook dispatch
              </?01M05F1P0VM6SE6BKM62PPYHWA>
            )>
            <Case #timeout-and-failure-policy [
              <Then ?01M05F1P0VM6SE6BKM62PPYHWB>
              dispatcher SHALL 记录 failed 或 timed_out diagnostic
              </?01M05F1P0VM6SE6BKM62PPYHWB>
              <Then ?01M05F1P0VM6SE6BKM62PPYHWC>
              dispatcher SHALL 根据 hook 的 failOpen 策略决定继续或停止本轮 dispatch
              </?01M05F1P0VM6SE6BKM62PPYHWC>
            ] (
              <Given ?01M05F1P0VM6SE6BKM62PPYHWD>
              hook 超时或抛错
              </?01M05F1P0VM6SE6BKM62PPYHWD>
              <When ?01M05F1P0VM6SE6BKM62PPYHWE>
              dispatcher 处理失败
              </?01M05F1P0VM6SE6BKM62PPYHWE>
            )>
            <Case #handler-invoked-by-func-style-adapter [
              <Then ?01M05F1P0VM6SE6BKM62PPYHWF>
              dispatcher SHALL use `depa-processor` `runByFuncStyleAdapter` to execute the hook handler component
              </?01M05F1P0VM6SE6BKM62PPYHWF>
              <Then ?01M05F1P0VM6SE6BKM62PPYHWG>
              hook handler SHALL express outer input、derived、inner runtime、inner input、inner config、core logic 与 outer output through the standard component flow
              </?01M05F1P0VM6SE6BKM62PPYHWG>
            ] (
              <Given ?01M05F1P0VM6SE6BKM62PPYHWH>
              dispatcher 准备执行某个 matched hook handler
              </?01M05F1P0VM6SE6BKM62PPYHWH>
              <When ?01M05F1P0VM6SE6BKM62PPYHWJ>
              dispatcher 调用该 handler
              </?01M05F1P0VM6SE6BKM62PPYHWJ>
            )>
          ]>
        )>
      ]>
    )>
    <Requirement #organ-hook-producer (
      <Statement ?01M05F1P0VM6SE6BKM62PPYHWK>
      系统 SHALL 在 `ai-organ-logic` 中生产 lifecycle hook invocation，调用同包 lifecycle hook dispatcher，并在 runtime 串行 mutation 边界应用 hook effects。
      </?01M05F1P0VM6SE6BKM62PPYHWK>
      <Suites [
        <Suite #producer-boundaries { name = "Producer boundaries" } (
          <Cases [
            <Case #interactive-turn-finished-produces-idle-check (
              <Given ?01M05F1P0VM6SE6BKM62PPYHWM>
              interactive turn 完成并清理 runtime active turn 标记
              </?01M05F1P0VM6SE6BKM62PPYHWM>
              <When ?01M05F1P0VM6SE6BKM62PPYHWN>
              runtime 进入可继续调度状态
              </?01M05F1P0VM6SE6BKM62PPYHWN>
              <Then ?01M05F1P0VM6SE6BKM62PPYHWP>
              organ runtime SHALL 生产 lifecycle invocation 用于检查 runtime idle
              </?01M05F1P0VM6SE6BKM62PPYHWP>
            )>
            <Case #background-watchdog-produces-idle-check [
              <Then ?01M05F1P0VM6SE6BKM62PPYHWQ>
              organ runtime MAY 生产 runtime idle lifecycle invocation
              </?01M05F1P0VM6SE6BKM62PPYHWQ>
              <Then ?01M05F1P0VM6SE6BKM62PPYHWR>
              watchdog SHALL NOT 直接调用具体 goal continuation 逻辑
              </?01M05F1P0VM6SE6BKM62PPYHWR>
            ] (
              <Given ?01M05F1P0VM6SE6BKM62PPYHWS>
              没有前台 turn 正在运行
              </?01M05F1P0VM6SE6BKM62PPYHWS>
              <When ?01M05F1P0VM6SE6BKM62PPYHWT>
              background watchdog tick 发生
              </?01M05F1P0VM6SE6BKM62PPYHWT>
            )>
            <Case #effects-apply-through-driver [
              <Then ?01M05F1P0VM6SE6BKM62PPYHWV>
              effects SHALL 通过 orchestrator driver 和 actor mailbox 机制应用
              </?01M05F1P0VM6SE6BKM62PPYHWV>
              <Then ?01M05F1P0VM6SE6BKM62PPYHWW>
              effect application SHALL 发生在 coordinator 串行 enqueue 边界内
              </?01M05F1P0VM6SE6BKM62PPYHWW>
            ] (
              <Given ?01M05F1P0VM6SE6BKM62PPYHWX>
              hook dispatcher 返回 mailbox enqueue 或 resume fiber effect
              </?01M05F1P0VM6SE6BKM62PPYHWX>
              <When ?01M05F1P0VM6SE6BKM62PPYHWY>
              organ runtime 应用 effects
              </?01M05F1P0VM6SE6BKM62PPYHWY>
            )>
          ]>
        )>
      ]>
    )>
    <Requirement #high-frequency-idle-orchestration (
      <Statement ?01M05F1P0VM6SE6BKM62PPYHWZ>
      系统 SHALL 对高频 `actor.idle.before` hook point 使用确定性、受预算约束、可重检状态的编排方式，避免多个 hooks 同时基于过期 idle 状态产生冲突 effects。
      </?01M05F1P0VM6SE6BKM62PPYHWZ>
      <Suites [
        <Suite #idle-cycle { name = "Idle cycle orchestration" } (
          <Cases [
            <Case #sequential-with-state-recheck [
              <Then ?01M05F1P0VM6SE6BKM62PPYHX0>
              dispatcher 或 producer SHALL 基于最新 VM/driver state 重建 idle snapshot
              </?01M05F1P0VM6SE6BKM62PPYHX0>
              <Then ?01M05F1P0VM6SE6BKM62PPYHX1>
              如果 runtime 已不再 idle，本轮 idle dispatch SHALL 停止
              </?01M05F1P0VM6SE6BKM62PPYHX1>
            ] (
              <Given ?01M05F1P0VM6SE6BKM62PPYHX2>
              同一 idle cycle 中有多个 `actor.idle.before` hooks 匹配
              </?01M05F1P0VM6SE6BKM62PPYHX2>
              <When ?01M05F1P0VM6SE6BKM62PPYHX3>
              dispatcher 准备执行下一个 idle hook
              </?01M05F1P0VM6SE6BKM62PPYHX3>
            )>
            <Case #stop-action-stops-current-idle-dispatch [
              <Then ?01M05F1P0VM6SE6BKM62PPYHX4>
              dispatcher SHALL stop subsequent hooks in the current `actor.idle.before` dispatch
              </?01M05F1P0VM6SE6BKM62PPYHX4>
              <Then ?01M05F1P0VM6SE6BKM62PPYHX5>
              如果 hook 返回 `continue` 或 `replace`，dispatcher SHALL 按标准结果合并规则继续或应用 payload/output/effect
              </?01M05F1P0VM6SE6BKM62PPYHX5>
            ] (
              <Given ?01M05F1P0VM6SE6BKM62PPYHX6>
              某个 idle hook 返回 `stop` action
              </?01M05F1P0VM6SE6BKM62PPYHX6>
              <When ?01M05F1P0VM6SE6BKM62PPYHX7>
              dispatcher 处理该 hook result
              </?01M05F1P0VM6SE6BKM62PPYHX7>
            )>
            <Case #budgeted-idle-cycle [
              <Then ?01M05F1P0VM6SE6BKM62PPYHX8>
              dispatcher SHALL 停止本轮 dispatch
              </?01M05F1P0VM6SE6BKM62PPYHX8>
              <Then ?01M05F1P0VM6SE6BKM62PPYHX9>
              dispatcher SHALL 发出 budget exhausted diagnostic
              </?01M05F1P0VM6SE6BKM62PPYHX9>
            ] (
              <Given ?01M05F1P0VM6SE6BKM62PPYHXA>
              idle hook list 很长或某些 hook 执行较慢
              </?01M05F1P0VM6SE6BKM62PPYHXA>
              <When ?01M05F1P0VM6SE6BKM62PPYHXB>
              本轮 idle dispatch 达到最大 hook 数或总耗时预算
              </?01M05F1P0VM6SE6BKM62PPYHXB>
            )>
          ]>
        )>
      ]>
    )>
    <Requirement #idle-hook-mailbox-preemption (
      <Statement ?01M05F1P0VM6SE6BKM62PPYHXC>
      系统 SHALL prevent `actor.idle.before` hooks from running as idle continuation while any wake-capable actor mailbox has pending work.
      </?01M05F1P0VM6SE6BKM62PPYHXC>
      <KnowledgeHint { target = "docs-profile" href = "vfs://docs/ai-runtime-lifecycle-hooks/idle-hook-mailbox-preemption" strength = "hint" }>
      <Suites [
        <Suite #idle-preemption { name = "Idle hook mailbox preemption" } (
          <Cases [
            <Case #all-wake-mailboxes-block-idle [
              <Then ?01M05F1P0VM6SE6BKM62PPYHXD>
              The producer SHALL treat the actor as non-idle
              </?01M05F1P0VM6SE6BKM62PPYHXD>
              <Then ?01M05F1P0VM6SE6BKM62PPYHXE>
              The dispatch SHALL stop before goal continuation or other idle effects are produced
              </?01M05F1P0VM6SE6BKM62PPYHXE>
            ] (
              <Given ?01M05F1P0VM6SE6BKM62PPYHXF>
              An actor has pending `control`, `toolResult`, `asyncCompletion`, `childDone`, `memberCoordination`, `humanInput`, `memberChatInbox`, or `heartbeat` entries
              </?01M05F1P0VM6SE6BKM62PPYHXF>
              <When ?01M05F1P0VM6SE6BKM62PPYHXG>
              The runtime evaluates `actor.idle.before`
              </?01M05F1P0VM6SE6BKM62PPYHXG>
            )>
            <Case #idle-recheck-reports-pending-mailboxes [
              <Then ?01M05F1P0VM6SE6BKM62PPYHXH>
              The diagnostic SHOULD include the pending mailbox kinds that made the actor non-idle
              </?01M05F1P0VM6SE6BKM62PPYHXH>
              <Then ?01M05F1P0VM6SE6BKM62PPYHXJ>
              Repeated equivalent diagnostics SHOULD be throttled or coalesced to avoid flooding orchestration history
              </?01M05F1P0VM6SE6BKM62PPYHXJ>
            ] (
              <Given ?01M05F1P0VM6SE6BKM62PPYHXK>
              An idle hook dispatch is skipped because lifecycle state is no longer current
              </?01M05F1P0VM6SE6BKM62PPYHXK>
              <When ?01M05F1P0VM6SE6BKM62PPYHXM>
              The runtime emits hook diagnostics
              </?01M05F1P0VM6SE6BKM62PPYHXM>
            )>
            <Case #background-watchdog-drains-before-idle-hook (
              <Given ?01M05F1P0VM6SE6BKM62PPYHXN>
              The background watchdog observes a ready fiber or pending wake mailbox work
              </?01M05F1P0VM6SE6BKM62PPYHXN>
              <When ?01M05F1P0VM6SE6BKM62PPYHXP>
              It performs a background tick
              </?01M05F1P0VM6SE6BKM62PPYHXP>
              <Then ?01M05F1P0VM6SE6BKM62PPYHXQ>
              The runtime SHALL attempt scheduler drain before producing lower-priority idle continuation effects
              </?01M05F1P0VM6SE6BKM62PPYHXQ>
            )>
          ]>
        )>
      ]>
    )>
  ]>
)>
